---
source: crates/agent/src/prompts.rs
expression: reduce
---
These consecutive parts of the recording are one topic. Write one digest of the whole topic.
Write everything in Russian.

[1] Отчёт — Сроки.
Decisions: Сдать в пятницу
Topics: сроки; отчёт
[2] Бюджет — Цифры.
Actions: Михаил проверит
Questions: Когда созвон?

Write a JSON object:
title — 3 to 8 words naming the whole topic, not just its first part;
summary — 1 to 3 sentences covering all the parts;
decisions — the decisions of all the parts, without repeats (empty when none);
actions — who will do what (a speaker by the label), without repeats (empty when none);
questions — questions still open at the end (drop those answered in a later part);
topics — 1 to 5 short keywords;
quotes — an empty list (the quotes of the parts are kept).
